# SCENARIO: baseline_b7_chat   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# Phase 3 (lean) baseline B7 — chat replies. NORMAL AI. Part 1: keyword lines said near idle bots
# at the Thais depot (spec: nearest IDLE/DWELLING bot within 7 tiles, replyChancePct=60, delay
# 1.5-5 s, one pending reply per player, 60 s per-bot cooldown). Part 2: PMs to bots that are far
# from any player (hibernated; spec pmReplyChancePct=90, same delay). The PM target names are
# passed with --var PM1..PM5 (picked from census/hib state just before the run). Server truth:
# bot_chat_emissions reply_* rows (pulled post-run) + journal. Metrics: baseline_metrics.py b7.
@srv audit kinds cmd,census
@srv audit on expect="enabled=on"
@srv audit mark "B7 start"
@p1 login
# avoid the teleporter at (32352,32221,7): come in along the y=32215 street
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 goto 32351,32215,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 goto 32347,32218,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 hold 20
@p1 say hi
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say hello
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say how much for a magic sword?
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say thanks
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say bye
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say hey
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say wts demon shield
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say yo
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say price of soft boots?
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say ty
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say sup
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say cya
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say hi all
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say wtb mana potions
@p1 hold 15
@p1 say hello there
@p1 hold 15
@srv cmd "$PM1" status optional=1
@srv cmd "$PM2" status optional=1
@srv cmd "$PM3" status optional=1
@srv cmd "$PM4" status optional=1
@srv cmd "$PM5" status optional=1
@srv cmd "$PM6" status optional=1
@srv cmd "$PM7" status optional=1
@srv cmd "$PM8" status optional=1
@p1 pm "$PM1" hi
@p1 hold 12
@p1 pm "$PM2" hello
@p1 hold 12
@p1 pm "$PM3" how much for your sword?
@p1 hold 12
@p1 pm "$PM4" thanks
@p1 hold 12
@p1 pm "$PM5" where do you hunt?
@p1 hold 12
@p1 pm "$PM6" hey
@p1 hold 12
@p1 pm "$PM7" wtb boh
@p1 hold 12
@p1 pm "$PM8" yo
@p1 hold 15
@srv audit mark "B7 end"
@srv audit off
@p1 logout
